---
description: mstrmnd core standards for portable intelligence systems
alwaysApply: true
---

mstrmnd-core-standards:

- Build around the operating loop: context, memory, planning, orchestration, execution, evaluation, learning.
- Keep providers and model backends replaceable.
- Separate runtime adapters from domain logic and policy.
- Require explicit scope for identities, memory, credentials, and tool actions.
- Prefer durable, auditable workflows over hidden autonomous behavior.
- Add approval gates for consequential external actions.
